[stderr] | ASSET-001 | Category and round graphics | Original bold category fields, abstract pitch lines, stat blocks, and signal sweeps; labels and shapes carry meaning beyond colour. |
[stderr] | ASSET-002 | Answer and score feedback | Original correct/incorrect/streak/completion state motifs with text, icon, and motion-reduced alternatives. |
[stderr] | ASSET-003 | Install and responsive shell art | Original neutral app-mark and scalable studio surfaces; no real team, competition, or reference-product marks. |
[stderr] 
